# Profiling example for ./bench profile: one control + one --enable_profiling run per cell (the run behind docs/profiling-subcommand-design.md, Pixel 8a 2026-09-12).
android litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B native-benchmark-128x256 backend=cpu file=qwen3_0_6b_mixed_int4.litertlm runs=1 context-tokens=1024
android litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-0.6B native-benchmark-128x256 backend=gpu file=qwen3_0_6b_mixed_int4.litertlm runs=1 context-tokens=1024
